40:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","code",null,{"children":"max_open_files"}]," is in that block for a related reason: a ",["$","code",null,{"children":"filesystem"}]," store\nholds file descriptors. At startup Forge tries to raise its own soft\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"nofile"}]," limit to this value (default 24576) and sizes an internal semaphore\nfrom whatever the kernel actually granted, so if the hard limit is lower the\neffective value is lower too, and a warning is logged."]}]
